# Real HTTP response headers for the deployed site. Production is
# Cloudflare Workers static assets (wrangler.jsonc), which reads this file
# from dist/ at deploy time, including for the pages the edge worker serves
# through env.ASSETS. There is no meta-tag equivalent for X-Frame-Options or
# X-Content-Type-Options — both are ignored by browsers unless set here (see
# docs/audit-1.0.2.md, finding on this).
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

# Vite content-hashes every file under /assets/ (index-DAtX3vG6.js), so a
# changed file always gets a new name: cache them for a year and never
# revalidate. HTML keeps the default max-age=0, so a deploy shows at once
# (1.6.18, docs/audit-1.6.16.md finding 3).
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
